# Files excluded from every Vercel deploy in this repo.
#
# IMPORTANT: this file lives at the repository root and Vercel applies it to ALL projects
# built from this repo, whichever Root Directory they use. Never list lmslocal-web/ or
# lmslocal-admin/ here - excluding an app directory deletes it before the build and the
# deploy fails with the Root Directory pointing at nothing.
#
# Each project's Root Directory setting already limits what gets built, so listing the
# other app here buys nothing. Only genuinely non-deployable directories belong below.
lmslocal-flutter/
lmslocal-server/
docs/
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
server-check.txt

# ...except the promo the landing page actually plays. The globs above exist to keep stray
# recordings out of a deploy, and they did that job silently to lmslocal-web/public/promo.mp4
# as well: the file was committed, the build succeeded, the poster beside it served fine, and
# the video 404ed because it had been deleted before the build ever ran. Nothing in the build
# log says so - "Collected static files" reports success either way.
#
# Negation only works because no parent directory of this path is excluded above. If
# lmslocal-web/ were ever listed here, this line would stop working and could not be made to.
!lmslocal-web/public/*.mp4
